<title>JAPAN: Konica, NTT mull Internet digital image service.</title>
<headline>Konica, NTT mull Internet digital image service.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Konica Corp and Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp (NTT) will study the feasibility of launching a digital image service using the Internet, Konica said on Friday.</p>
<p>They will study the possibility of setting up an on-line photo library service, Konica said in a statement.</p>
<p>They will also consider taking orders for printing and other photo processing services through the Internet, Konica said.</p>
</text>
